----+---------------------+-----------------------
  1 | beer wine 1         | category 2 (updated)
  2 | beer cheese 2       | category 3 (updated)
  3 | beer 3              | category 4 (updated)
  8 | beer wine cheese 8  | category 9 (updated)
  9 | beer wine 9         | category 10 (updated)
